<section class="rkt-section">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    <div class="rkt-split">
      <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
        {{ sechead("Why give?", "Because talent needs thrust") }}
        <p>Rocket student-athletes commit to excellence twice over — once in their sport, and once in the classroom. The Rocket Fund provides the essential financial support that makes both possible: scholarships, academic assistance, and the equipment needs of 17 varsity programs.</p>
        <p>Philanthropic gifts to the Rocket Fund are <strong>above and beyond</strong> any required payments for seating and parking. They are a direct investment in the people who wear midnight blue and gold — and they give Toledo Athletics the flexibility to meet its most important priorities.</p>
        <p>Every gift, at every level, moves the program. And beginning at $100 a year, giving comes with <a href="/benefits/">benefits and privileges</a> that grow with your support.</p>
      </div>
      {{ figureSlot("Rockets celebrate a championship", "/assets/img/impact/impact-1.jpg", "Toledo Rockets celebrate a championship win", 1600, 900) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

