<section class="rkt-section">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
      {{ sechead("How it works", "One annual gift, a full year of benefits") }}
      <p>Rocket Fund giving runs on an annual cycle. Your total giving for the year sets your donor level, which determines benefits like priority seating assistance, parking assignments, and hospitality access at Savage Arena.</p>
      <p>Prefer to give beyond the annual cycle? Explore the <a href="/ways-to-give/legacy-society/">Rocket Fund Legacy Society</a> to endow your support in perpetuity, or <a href="/ways-to-give/gamechange/">GameChange</a> to give a little with every purchase, all year long.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

